Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.62,0:00:30.64,Coni,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1344)}vienen esas dudas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.46,0:00:32.66,Coni,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1344)}Vas a aprender a cambiar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.92,0:00:34.20,Coni,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1344)}las ideas que te frenan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.08,0:00:36.44,Coni,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1344)}Y vas a cultivar tu amor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.58,0:00:38.06,Coni,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1344)}propio y tu inteligencia
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:38.66,Coni,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1344)}emocional.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.58,0:00:40.94,Coni,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1344)}Si ya te cansaste de
